    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.AN.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Exsultavit spiritus noster, hoc firmiter te piissime esse imperator, quod apostolica fides præ­ dicat, credentes quod a rectae credulitatis tramite non declines.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 544,
    "date_range": [
      544,
      545
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an#PL67.AN.4.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.AN.4.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Talem enim decet esse imperatorem, pium, justum, fidelem, qualem te nos esse cognovi­ mus.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 544,
    "date_range": [
      544,
      545
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an#PL67.AN.4.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.AN.4.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In extremo itaque epistolæ vestræ cognovimus, quod nos non mediocriter remordet, debere nos Theodorum, et scripta Theodoreti et epistolam Ibæ damnare.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 544,
    "date_range": [
      544,
      545
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an#PL67.AN.4.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pontianus-africanus/pl67_34_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.AN.4.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Eorum dicta ad nos usque nunc minime pervenerunt. Quod si et pervenerint, et aliqua ibi apo­ crypha, quae contra fidei regulam dicta sint legeri­ mus ;",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 544,
    "date_range": [
      544,
      545
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
